    kind: work_item  # 15c9
    title: "java: System.out/err method calls carry an external module slot although the field fixes the receiver type (java.io.PrintStream), so every one counts as an untyped-receiver site"  # 15c9
    status: todo_hard  # 15c9
    priority: 3  # 15c9
